Weights and voices are separate works
-------------------------------------
Code licenses above do not cover model weights or voice models. They are
downloaded at bootstrap into MODEL_CACHE_PATH and are never committed to this
repository. Each carries its own terms, and the manifest records them per
component — including the entries that are explicitly not cleared for
commercial use:

  - Seamless Communication: CC-BY-NC 4.0, recorded BLOCKED_FOR_COMMERCIAL. It is
    not enabled by any default configuration here.
  - Silero VAD weights: CC-BY-NC, recorded PENDING; the default VAD is the
    energy-based one, so nothing ships that depends on that clearance.
  - Argos translation packages: per-package terms (some derived from data with
    non-commercial licences), recorded PER_PACKAGE_REVIEW_REQUIRED. Review the
    specific package you install before using it commercially.
  - AI4Bharat Indic models (indic-conformer-asr, indic-parler-tts): recorded
    PENDING, per model release.
  - Piper voices: per-voice licence; the manifest records which voices were
    checked.

