Authorized API use
------------------
When an optional provider is configured — for example DEEPL_API_KEY for the
DeepL text-translation API, or Twilio/SUPABASE credentials — requests are made
with the operator's own key, under that provider's terms, from
`ai/gt_ai/translation/neural_online.py` and the corresponding service modules.
No provider's translation output, dictionary data or example sentences are
redistributed with this repository. Dictionary and synonym content shown in the
writing tool comes from this project's own curated lexicon
(`services/api/app/services/write_service.py`).
